# The Edge deploy payload is fingerprinted by sha256 over its exact bytes
# (tools/pack-edge.mjs -> payload-hash.js -> the deployed GET -> the smoke guard).
# With core.autocrlf=true a Windows worktree hands the packer CRLF while a Linux
# checkout hands it LF, so the SAME COMMIT packs to two different hashes and the
# guard fails on whichever machine did not do the deploy. Pin every file that
# feeds that payload to LF so the fingerprint is a property of the commit.
supabase/functions/** text eol=lf
src/core/** text eol=lf
src/data/** text eol=lf
